    "body": "\n## Problem\n\nFollowup to #40897\n\n\n- Reflow is bolted-on beside the raw-column code: conceal-aware copies\n  of the motion, mouse and vcol walks, a third \"layout column\" kind,\n  parallel state (walkers, caches, flags), and rows that\n  redraw-and-rollback.\n- Numerous bugs: wrong cursor/click/TAB positions, stale heights (Visual\n  area, skipcol), reads of freed marktree nodes, and every line on the\n  slow path if ANY conceal mark exists.\n\n## Solution\n- Change the existing code: one displayed->raw vcol map feeds the base\n  coladvance(), vcol2col() and nv_screengo(); one conceal_replacement()\n  rule serves :syntax, matchadd() and extmarks.\n- Calculate, don't track: only raw vcols and displayed vcols\n  conceal.\n  - Eliminates `ConcealWalk`, `LinebreakState`, `ConcealOffState`,\n    `ConcealSizeState`, `conceal_cursor_win`, the provider-namespace\n    map, etc. Rows without conceal marks stay on the fast path.\n- Flat control flow: a row ends at the line's displayed size, with no\n  \"roll-back\".\n- One name per concept: \"extmark-conceal\", \"displayed vcol\", defined\n  once at `CharsizeArg.extconceal_off`.\n- Invalidate what changed: when 'concealcursor' reveals or conceals\n  lines again, only those line-heights are invalidated, in every window.\n- Treesitter: one row-hook parses each row before concealing it, so rows\n  not yet drawn are measured concealed. The redraw parse is synchronous\n  only when a window shows conceal.\n- Tests: extend existing ones, table-driven, `screen:expect`, no\n  internals.\n\nPERF COST: a row's first conceal check parses and queries that row\nalone (~28 µs per row in `:help`). One CTRL-F page in a 50-line window\ntakes 1.6 ms in options.txt (master: 0.3 ms) and 2.9 ms in lua.txt\n(master: 0.45 ms). Markdown pays the same on master via\n`_on_conceal_line`. Potential fixes:\n- #36030: LanguageTree keeps injected trees across parse ranges (the\n  per-row parse cost).\n- #41913: checks conceal a window-height of rows at a time (the per-row\n  query cost).\n\nCode cost:\n\n    ┌────────────────────┬────────────────────┬───────────────────┬────────┐\n    │        Area        │      PR #40897     │     Now (net)     │ Change │\n    ├────────────────────┼────────────────────┼───────────────────┼────────┤\n    │ C (src/)           │ +1961 −394 (+1567) │ +1306 −500 (+806) │ −49%   │\n    ├────────────────────┼────────────────────┼───────────────────┼────────┤\n    │ Lua (runtime/lua/) │ +244 −54 (+190)    │ +187 −60 (+127)   │ −33%   │\n    ├────────────────────┼────────────────────┼───────────────────┼────────┤\n    │ Tests              │ +3418 −55 (+3363)  │ +3004 −25 (+2979) │ −11%   │\n    ├────────────────────┼────────────────────┼───────────────────┼────────┤\n    │ Total              │ +5134              │ +3921             │ −24%   │\n    └────────────────────┴────────────────────┴───────────────────┴────────┘\n",
